  "slug": "space-with-margin",
  "title": "用 margin 表达外部间距",
  "prompt": "给相邻的 .section 设置外部垂直间距；不要把 margin 混进组件内部 padding。",
  "order": 2,
  "status": "draft",
  "hints": [
    "先区分内部空间和 box 外部的相邻间距。",
    "题目说的是 section 之间的外部 spacing，所以不要把答案写成 padding。",
    "对 .section 设置 margin-block: 20px。"
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "external-spacing-top",
      "type": "style",
      "selector": ".section",
      "property": "margin-top",
      "equals": "20px",
      "message": "用 20px 的外部 margin 表达 section 间距"
    },
    {
      "id": "external-spacing-bottom",
      "type": "style",
      "selector": ".section",
      "property": "margin-bottom",
      "equals": "20px",
      "message": "保留 section 的 block-end 外部间距"
    }
  ]
